\newlabel{fig:monge-sphere-mccann-interpolation}{{2.8}{26}{\emph {Intrinsic McCann interpolation on the upper hemisphere.} Here \(\mathcal X=\{x\in \RR ^3:\norm {x}=1,\ x_3\geq 0\}\) and \(d_{\mathcal X}(x,y)=\arccos (\dotp {x}{y})\). The thin violet curves are minimizing geodesics, and the colored points show the interpolation at \(t=0,1/4,1/2,3/4,1\)}{figure.2.8}{}}
